@startuml
title Coupon validation - Conquista
actor Company
boundary Frontend
control Router
control AuthService
control CouponService
entity Repository
database PostgreSQL
Company -> Frontend: enter coupon code
Frontend -> Router: POST /cupons/consultar + JWT
Router -> AuthService: require EMPRESA and validate JWT
Router -> CouponService: consult(company id from JWT)
CouponService -> Repository: find coupon owned by company
Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT coupon and redemption
PostgreSQL --> Repository: coupon state
Repository --> CouponService: coupon state
CouponService --> Router: consultation result
Router --> Frontend: coupon details
Company -> Frontend: confirm in-person redemption
Frontend -> Router: POST /cupons/validar + JWT
Router -> AuthService: require EMPRESA and validate JWT
Router -> CouponService: validate(company id from JWT)
CouponService -> Repository: conditional mark as used
Repository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE once and commit
PostgreSQL --> Repository: commit or conflict
Repository --> CouponService: final state
CouponService --> Router: validation result
Router --> Frontend: valid or already used
@enduml
